    <h2 class="headline headline--center">2026</h2>
    <div class="prose">
      <p>We are creating — together with a remarkable Mexican astrologer and facilitator — an unforgettable journey. We will share more details as they come together.</p>
      <p>Drawing on my own story (ten years as a nomad), I want to offer a way of travelling that nourishes you not only through the gastronomy and culture of a place, but through its people. I am building an experience that gives you a more sensual and vivid perspective — one that helps you grow personally in a way that is holistic, intrinsic, and permanently imprinted in your body. Because simply placing yourself in a new location as a human being allows your most essential self to reveal itself. When we travel, part of us stays behind at the point of departure. All those beliefs we built up in our familiar environment seem to dissolve, because the setting has changed — and so your being must expose itself once again to something new. Let yourself be carried into a journey that will, without question, shift your perspective on yourself and on the situations of your everyday life. Perspective always helps with the next leap into your new life.</p>
    </div>
